    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, can you check the sync status for the neuroplasticity data? i want to make sure we aren't hitting any latency issues before the mid-month batch upload. also, let me know if there's any scheduled maintenance on the 17th that i should be aware of so the sync doesn't get borked.",
